### JavaScript Execution & Main-Thread Blocking
The page spends over **23 seconds** on main-thread work, with nearly **11 seconds** dedicated just to evaluating JavaScript. This is what causes the high Total Blocking Time, making the page feel frozen or unresponsive during load.
