The page is ineligible for the **Back/Forward Cache** because it uses `Cache-Control: no-store`. This means every time a user goes back to this page, it has to be completely reloaded.
*   **Fix**: If security requirements allow, remove `no-store` from the header to enable instant back/forward navigation.

